  "text": "Hello all — I need to set up next week's CSE455 staff meeting (Mon 23 – Fri 27 November).\n\nThe windows I have free that week are:\n- Tue 11:00-11:30\n- Tue 15:00-15:30\n- Wed 10:00-10:30\n- Wed 13:00-13:30\n\nCould each of you tell me which of those work for you, and whether half an hour is enough? If none of them suit you, send me your own free slots for next week and I'll find the overlap.",
  "seq": 0,
