  "text": "Hi Alvarez — all four windows work for me:\n\n- Tue 23, 11:00-11:30\n- Tue 23, 15:00-15:30\n- Wed 24, 10:00-10:30\n- Wed 24, 13:00-13:30\n\nHalf an hour is enough for a staff meeting. If it helps you choose: Tue 11:00-11:30 is right after the CSE455 quiz section, and Wed 10:00-10:30 is right after my CSE444 focus block — either is easy for me. I'll keep the slot you pick clear.",
