  "text": "Hi all — Diego here. Of the four windows, three work for me:\n\n- Tue 15:00-15:30 — free\n- Wed 10:00-10:30 — free\n- Wed 13:00-13:30 — free\n\nTue 11:00-11:30 doesn't work: it runs into my CSE452 lab focus block (10:20-11:20) and lunch (11:20-12:50).\n\nHalf an hour is enough for me. Wed 13:00-13:30 or Wed 10:00-10:30 would be my first choices, but any of the three is fine — I'll keep the slot once you pick.",
