  "text": "Hi Professor — all four windows work for me: Tue 11:00-11:30, Tue 15:00-15:30, Wed 10:00-10:30 and Wed 13:00-13:30 are all clear in my calendar. Half an hour is enough for a staff meeting; if it runs into agenda follow-ups I can stay a bit longer on Tuesday. Go with whichever slot suits the others and I'll block it off once you confirm.\n\n— John",
